   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP1023_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>hcʾlʾnwšʾḇyˈʾṭ ʾclmykṭwm ʾḤ dʾṭynbwhṭ
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>ŠRM W KRʾ plhwyh PWN MRʿḤ YḤWWNʾṭ
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>◯ MRʿḤ MN ẔK Y ʾṭhš Y ʾdl-dlhṭˈ
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>W ẔK ḤMRʾ PWN ʾsp̄ ʾkrṭˈ Y ẔK lwsṭˈ
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>ẔK Y pyš pylwcʾwhrmzd Y ʾp̄lkʾn-c
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>hwʾsṭˈ Y ŠNṬ I-C-III ʿL glṭ-wndʾṭ ẔK GTk
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>wlcyṭnˈ Y PWN ʾknc ʾsp̄-wlc Y NPŠH
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>lʾd zmyk G-X ʿL plhwgwšnsp̄ˈ Y dpywr
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>YḤBWNṭˈ MNW ʾp̄ʾyṭ plmʾn YḤBWN ckˈ
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>BYRḤ ddwˈ QDM ŠNṬ I-C-II YWM
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trl-p1-l11"/>Dynˈ krṭˈ           
            </ab>
            <ab xml:id="MP1023_trl-p2">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p2-l1"/>MN | MNW-ṭ kwlkˈ
            </ab> 
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP1023_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>A hazār-anōšayād āzarmīgtom brād Dādēnbōxt
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>A3 drōd ud harw farroxīh pad xwadāy bawād
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>◯ B xwadāy az ān ī ātaxš ī ēr-draxt
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>ud ān xar pad asp a-kard ī ān rust
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>ān ī pēš Pērōzōhrmazd ī abaragān-iz
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>xwāst ī sāl 103 ō gird-windād ān nāmag
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>warzīd(?)n ī pad a-ganǰ aspwarz ī xwēš
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>rāy zamīg g(rīw) 10 ō Farroxgušnasp ī dibīr
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>dād kē abāyēd framān dah Bz čak
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>māh Day abar sāl 102 rōz
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>Dēn kard 
            </ab>
            <ab xml:id="MP1023_trc-p2">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p2-l1"/>az kē-t kurrag
            </ab> 
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP1023_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>A Brother Dādēnbōxt with thousand-fold immortal remembrance
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>A3 greetings and every happiness for You should be!
               <lb n="3-5" xml:id="trans-p1-l3-5"/>◯ Sir, since - because of the fire of the undergrowth (low bushes) and that donkey instead of a horse that *fallow land is unworked -
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>you asked this before Pērōzōhrmazd the superior that, in the year 103, in order to collect gain (gird-windād) according to the document
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>for (rāy, line 8) tilling by his own horses’ work free of charge
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>10 grīw (of seeds) for the land to Farroxgušnasp, the scribe, [the scribe]
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trans-p1-l9"/>it is necessary to give: give the order! Bz He made the čak month Day (10th month) in the year 102, day Den (24th day).
            </ab>
            <ab xml:id="MP1023_trans-p2">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p2-l1"/>From this one who is your Kurrag.
            </ab> 
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>